YUNG's Bridges for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of YUNG's Bridges 4.0.3 by YUNGNICKYOUNG.
Original source: https://github.com/yungnickyoung/YUNGs-Bridges
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the GNU LGPL v3 text (the jar has no licence file); COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on.
